sequenceDiagram
  participant BA as Browser A
  participant A as Peer daemon A
  participant B as Peer daemon B
  participant C as Peer daemon C
  participant T as Tracker
  participant BB as Browser B
  BA->>A: POST /api/send {channel: general, text}
  Note over A: build CHAT frame, encrypt text with AES-GCM<br/>(visible fields = AAD), store own copy
  par direct delivery to every connected peer
    A->>B: TCP: [len][CHAT frame]
    Note over B: reassemble frame, decrypt,<br/>drop duplicate ids, store as seq m
  and
    A-xC: TCP connect fails (C unreachable)
  end
  A->>T: POST /relay {peer_id, token, targets: [C], frame}
  T->>C: TCP: [len][CHAT frame] (still encrypted)
  T-->>A: {delivered: [C]}
  A-->>BA: 200 {message, delivery: direct [B], relayed [C]}
  loop every 1.5 s
    BB->>B: GET /api/messages?after=m-1
    B-->>BB: new messages (UI renders, badge, toast)
  end
